-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 24.1.2008 (ארגון המורים) — העותק שנשלח בפקס: a second copy
-- of the erosion agreement of 24.1.2008, which the corpus publishes beside
-- the copy it is encoded from (`2008-01-24_oz-latmura_erosion-arbitration-award`,
-- "the primary"). Both print the Treasury's reference שכ. 2007-8642 on the
-- same signature page; this one is the faxed copy, with its own Registrar's
-- stamp (15.5.2008, number 42/2008). Its three agreement pages are the
-- primary's text row for row, so each row is cited "as in the primary", by
-- the rule that encodes it there, and this file imports the primary.
--
-- THE CORPUS'S FILE NAME SAYS 1999–2001 and the page settles the second
-- period, 2002–2007; 1999–2001 is the award of 22.5.2007 that the recitals
-- cite (the corpus's reading ledger; renaming moves a work URI, MMS-86).
--
-- ITS FOURTH PAGE is the wages commissioner's letter of the same day (שכ.
-- 590-2008), which the agreement of 24.1.2008 on the wage supplement
-- (`2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model`, imported) carries
-- signed as its third letter, and which is encoded there. This copy is
-- unsigned, leaves the agreement's date a blank rule and prints "תוחל"
-- where the signed copy prints "תוזל" — the corpus marks both — and the
-- rule is the signed copy's.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `2008-01-24_oz-latmura_erosion-arbitration-award`
IMPORT `2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model`

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: the word the batch found is
-- "בעל-פה" (the parties plead before the arbitrators orally or in
-- writing); the agreement pays nothing by sex.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — תשלום בגין שחיקת שכר עובדי הוראה מול שכר המהנדסים לשנים 2002–2007 (ארגון המורים, 24.1.2008), העותק שנשלח בפקס`

